# Service Layer Rules
# Applies to: Business logic, transaction management, facade pattern

---

## Package Location

```
src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/
├── ClinicService.java        # Interface (facade for all domain operations)
├── ClinicServiceImpl.java    # Implementation
├── UserService.java          # User-specific interface
└── UserServiceImpl.java      # User-specific implementation
```

---

## Architecture Pattern

The **ClinicService** acts as a **FACADE** - a single entry point for all controllers.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              REST Controllers                        │
│  (OwnerRestController, PetRestController, etc.)     │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                      │
                      ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              ClinicService (Facade)                  │
│  - Single entry point for all operations            │
│  - Transaction management                           │
│  - Exception handling                               │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                      │
         ┌────────────┼────────────┐
         ▼            ▼            ▼
┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐
│OwnerRepository│ │PetRepository │ │VetRepository │
└──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘
```

