## Transaction Propagation

| Method Type | Annotation | Reason |
|-------------|------------|--------|
| Read single | `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` | Performance optimization |
| Read collection | `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` | Performance optimization |
| Create/Update | `@Transactional` | Needs write access |
| Delete | `@Transactional` | Needs write access |

---

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|------|
| Use field injection | Use constructor injection |
| Forget `@Transactional` | Add to all service methods |
| Use `@Transactional` for reads | Use `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` |
| Throw exceptions for not found | Return null, let controller handle 404 |
| Access repository from controller | Use ClinicService facade |
| Put business logic in controller | Put in service layer |
